From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:53:19 +0100
Subject: Use SKIPIF instead of EXTENSIONS in the soap tests

run-tests.php of PHP 5.6 looks up the modules named in an EXTENSIONS
section in the compiled-in extension_dir and not in the one it was given
with -d, so these tests, which came with the security fixes backported
from PHP 8, start with a warning about a soap.so that cannot be loaded.
Use the SKIPIF section of the other soap tests instead.
---
 ext/soap/tests/GHSA-85c2-q967-79q5.phpt            | 4 ++--
 ext/soap/tests/GHSA-hmxp-6pc4-f3vv.phpt            | 4 ++--
 ext/soap/tests/GHSA-m33r-qmcv-p97q.phpt            | 4 ++--
 ext/soap/tests/GHSA-rgrp-mwpx-f6rm-href-chain.phpt | 4 ++--
 ext/soap/tests/GHSA-rgrp-mwpx-f6rm-href-cycle.phpt | 4 ++--
 ext/soap/tests/GHSA-rgrp-mwpx-f6rm.phpt            | 4 ++--
 6 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ext/soap/tests/GHSA-85c2-q967-79q5.phpt b/ext/soap/tests/GHSA-85c2-q967-79q5.phpt
index 8bcac26..4ce36a4 100644
--- a/ext/soap/tests/GHSA-85c2-q967-79q5.phpt
+++ b/ext/soap/tests/GHSA-85c2-q967-79q5.phpt
@@ -2,8 +2,8 @@
 GHSA-85c2-q967-79q5: Stale SOAP_GLOBAL(ref_map) pointer with Apache Map
 --CREDITS--
 brettgervasoni
---EXTENSIONS--
-soap
+--SKIPIF--
+<?php require_once('skipif.inc'); ?>
 --FILE--
 <?php
 
